  "contract": "The Ascension creaturecache.wdb captures (up to 2026-09-05) give the Redridge rares Thuros Lightfingers 61, Rohh the Silent 947, Lost One Cook 1106, Seeker Aqualon 14269, Squiddic 14270, Ribchaser 14271, Snarlflare 14272 and Boulderheart 14273 rank 2 (rare elite); the server carried rank 4 (rare), which Creature::isElite excludes. An elite kill multiplies the base gain by Rate.XP.Elite 1.44 (Formulas.cpp), so it awards about 1.44 times a normal kill of the same level whatever Rate.XP.Kill and Rate.XP.Global are (truncation keeps the ratio within 1.41-1.46), and a rank-4 rare awards the same as a normal kill. Redridge Alpha 445, Boulderheart, Ribchaser and Rohh the Silent are pinned to level 20 so all share one base gain; none has a per-creature experience modifier. The warrior carries melee_hit_rating, expertise_rating and melee_crit_rating 10000 for the reason given in xp-ascension-rates.json: none of them enters the XP calculation.",
